 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "Why did oil prices go up so much this year?",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.94
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "In February, a barrel of oil cost 72 dollars.",
   "s": 3.56,
   "e": 6.86
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "Then on February 28th, the US and Israel went to war with Iran.",
   "s": 7.4,
   "e": 12.12
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "And Iran did what everyone feared. It shut the Strait of Hormuz.",
   "s": 12.7,
   "e": 16.66
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "This gap is just 21 miles wide, and a fifth of the world's oil sails through it.",
   "s": 17.3,
   "e": 22.66
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
